                                    "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                                    "args": {
                                      "text": [
                                        "Which improvement\nbudget can be\npromised without\ntaking tokens from",
                                        "basic service? The\nsame budget\napplies to every\nemphasis. It\ndefines",
                                        "the honest amount\nany of the three\nproposals may\nspend first. Pip",
                                        "will read the\nfigure before the\nribbon, because an\ninspiring",
                                        "proposal is still\na promise somebody\nmust be able to\nkeep."
                                      ],
                                      "avatarId": "",
                                      "minHeight": 4,
                                      "maxHeight": 7,
                                      "position": "bottom",
                                      "closeWhen": "key",
