                                                "args": {
                                                  "text": [
                                                    "The Margin",
                                                    "The grid plan\nleaves spare\ncapacity marked in\npencil. Slush\nfirst",
                                                    "called it unused\nvalue. Rivet\ncalled it room for\na fault. The\npencil",
                                                    "note now says\nboth, with enough\nspace underneath\nto record what",
                                                    "happens. Neither\nhas erased the\nother person's\nhandwriting."
                                                  ],
